Below is the ST code incorporating sensor drift detection, HIL digital twin sync, and a pre-start self-test sequence to harden the system against adversarial sensor degradation and physical discrepancies.

```pascal
PROGRAM Extruder_Adversarial
VAR
    PressureSensor_A : REAL;
    PressureSensor_B : REAL;
    PressureDrift_Dev : REAL;
