FUNCTION_BLOCK TcoAo EXTENDS TcoCore.TcoComponent
VAR_IN_OUT
    (*~
	<docu>
		<summary>
			Controlled signal. Typically an `%Q* : INT` ,`%Q* : DINT` variable. 												
		</summary>				
	</docu>	
